## 4. Office Utilities, File Converters & Tools
*Secondary utilities for content creators, students, and office users to handle everyday file tasks locally.*

- [Image Resizer](https://pooreyoutuber.github.io/image-resize.html): Crop, stretch, or resize image dimensions instantly without quality loss.
- [Photo to PDF](https://pooreyoutuber.github.io/photo-to-pdf.html): Convert multiple image files into a single, organized PDF document locally.
- [Image Compressor](https://pooreyoutuber.github.io/image-compressor): Reduce image file sizes directly in the browser while maintaining image sharpness.
- [Image to Word](https://pooreyoutuber.github.io/ms-word.html): Extract text from screenshots and image files into editable Word documents.
- [PDF Compressor](https://pooreyoutuber.github.io/pdf-compress.html): Shrink PDF document file sizes safely inside your browser memory.
- [PDF Crop](https://pooreyoutuber.github.io/pdf-crop.html): Trim margins, borders, and unwanted white space from PDF pages.
- [PDF Merge](https://pooreyoutuber.github.io/pdf-merge.html): Combine multiple PDF documents into a single organized file.
- [Video to Image](https://pooreyoutuber.github.io/video-to-image.html): Extract high-resolution still frames and screenshots from video files.
- [Text to Handwriting](https://pooreyoutuber.github.io/handwriting.html): Convert typed text into realistic handwritten notes for assignments and creative assets.
- [EMI Calculator](https://pooreyoutuber.github.io/emi.html): Calculate monthly loan EMIs, interest rates, and payment schedules accurately.
- [MP3 Audio Checker](https://pooreyoutuber.github.io/mp3.html): Inspect audio file formats, bitrates, sample rates, and file integrity offline.

